# ---> Go
# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Build output (mise run build, goreleaser)
/bin/
/dist/

# Local configuration (may contain secrets)
/forgemirror.yaml

# Persistent runtime state and local agent/browser test artifacts
/data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db.lock
/.superpowers/

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/


# Helm chart dependencies (restored from Chart.lock by helm dependency build)
/charts/forgemirror/charts/

# Documentation build output (mise run docs:build)
/docs/public/
/docs/resources/
/docs/.hugo_build.lock

# Stray outputs of ad-hoc commands run from the repo root instead of the
# mise tasks: `go build cmd/forgemirror/main.go` / `go build ./cmd/forgemirror`
# and `hugo` without `--source docs`.
/main
/forgemirror
/public/
/.hugo_build.lock
